<title>POLAND: Polish trader BEST IPO 13.5 pct oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Polish trader BEST IPO 13.5 pct oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:  trader BEST SA</p>
<p> Type of Issue: common shares ex-rights</p>
<p> Total No of Shares Offered:    1,500,000</p>
<p> Total No of Shares Subscribed: 1,702,545</p>
<p> Price (PLN):	58</p>
<p> TRANCHES	 NO OF SHARES  NO OF SHARES</p>
<p>		     SUBSCRIBED     ALLOTTED</p>
<p>Institutional  1,444,000	1,241,455*</p>
<p> Retail	     258,545	  258,545</p>
<p>NOTE: * The company said all investors who took part in book-building in the large investor tranche received all the shares they ordered and other investors had their orders reduced by about 60 or 54.6 percent, depending on whether they bought existing or new shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
